index 119767bdcfbd7bdef748049caa4acce6f8bf1f08..30f88637bd0194d77d576b9a54b39513f309a1b0 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -67,6 +67,21 @@ prop to specific packs, narrower than the site-wide allow list:
       x-canvas-icon: ['bootstrap_icons']
 ```
 
+A prop may also carry a JSON Schema `enum` to curate the exact icons an
+editor can choose. Canvas would normally turn an `enum` into a select list;
+with `x-canvas-icon` the picker wins and offers only those icons, and stores
+the value in the form the `enum` declares — a `pack:icon` id verbatim, a bare
+icon id without its pack. A bare id matches that icon in every allowed pack,
+so pair it with the array form of `x-canvas-icon` when packs overlap:
+
+```yaml
+    icon:
+      type: string
+      title: Icon
+      enum: ['sun', 'umbrella']
+      x-canvas-icon: true
+```
+
 The widget renders a `canvas_icon_picker` form element (chip + hidden
 textfield); JavaScript populates the drawer from two endpoints:
 
